183 - I Will Sing of Jesus' Love
 / 
Key: Bb
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 183
Topic: Jesus Christ - 

Verse 1:
[Bb]I will sing of Jesus' love, Sing of Him, who first loved me;
[Bb]For He left bright worlds above, [F7]And died on [Bb]Cal-vary.
[F]I will sing of Jesus' love Endless praise [F7]my heart shall give;
[F7]He has died that [Eb/Bb]I might live [Bb]I will sing His love to me.

Refrain:
[Bb]I will sing of Jesus love
[Bb]Endless praise my heart shall give;
[Bb]He has died that [Eb]I might live
[Eb]I will sing His love to me.

Verse 2:
[Bb]O the depths of love divine!
[Bb]Earth or heaven [F7]can never [Bb]know
[F]How that sin as dark [F7]as mine
[F7]can be [Eb/Bb]made as [Bb]white as snow.

Verse 3:
[Bb]Nothing good for Him I've done;
[Bb]How could He such [F7]love bestow?
[F]Lord, I own my heart [F7]is won,
[F7]help me [Eb/Bb]now my [Bb]love to show.
